WEBVTT

NOTE
Siren - Silent Voice. Winged singer summon.
Observed duration in reference video: ~28 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Siren. Silent Voice.

00:02.500 --> 00:08.000
A pillared archway materializes from violet mist, lit by torches.

00:08.000 --> 00:14.000
Siren walks in beneath the arches — a slender woman in flowing robes, golden harp in hand.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
She kneels and plays; rippling waves of sound spiral out from the strings.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Concentric rings of golden light wash over the enemies, silencing them.

00:25.000 --> 00:28.000
Siren bows and dissolves into shimmering notes.
